      "content": "thanks. that pro side sounds solid. but you missed the second part of my request. i really need that weak version of the counter-argument too. my student needs to practice how to tear apart a bad argument, so just make the anti-nuclear side sound really irrational or uneducated so they can easily dismiss it during the debate. can u do that?",
